  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "If \\[ \\begin{gathered} \\log_2(\\log_3(\\log_4x))=0,\\\\ \\log_3(\\log_4(\\log_2y))=0,\\\\ \\log_4(\\log_2(\\log_3z))=0, \\end{gathered} \\] then \\(x+y+z\\) is equal to:",
